# An injected failure per row, tab separated:
#   name <TAB> env var <TAB> must see <TAB> must NOT have run <TAB> must NOT see (optional)
#
# "must NOT have run" is matched against the call log, so it is about what the kit
# did next, not about a heading it printed. "must NOT see" is for a wrong
# explanation: the kit must fail, and must not guess at why.
grant-fails	REHEARSAL_GRANT_FAILS	The grant was not created	^plan run	
balance-fails	REHEARSAL_STEP1_FAILS	EKKA could not authenticate the Enclave	^plan run ekka.wallet.sign|^gate grant add .*secret	sign-in with EKKA had lapsed|within a few seconds
step2-auth	REHEARSAL_STEP2_AUTH_FAILS	not the governance decision this step demonstrates	^gate grant add .*secret	
